{
  "presses": ["L-pinky-top", "R-index-home-in", "R-pinky-top", "R-ring-home"],
  "note": "T3: {L-pinky-top,L-index-home-in}= {I,Z} (since R-pinky-top=U, R-ring-home=W). Therefore R-index-home-in=c=F now (it’s the remaining of {F,I,Z} while a,b are I/Z at press time). Plan T4 press a+c+d+f = {L-pinky-top,R-index-home-in,R-pinky-top,R-ring-home} to resolve a=I vs Z. Track any rotation affecting these keys."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-index-home-in", "L-middle-top", "L-pinky-top", "R-index-home-in"],
  "note": "Known (post T5, unrotated): L-pinky-top=F; R-pinky-top=U; R-ring-home=W; R-index-home-in=Z. Last-rotated set permuted after T5: A=L-index-home-in, B=L-middle-top, C=R-middle-top (letters are 3 distinct symbols, none of {F,U,W,Z}). T6 press {A,B,L-pinky-top(F),R-index-home-in(Z)} to get {F,Z}+two letters for {A,B}. T7 press {A,C,L-pinky-top(F),R-index-home-in(Z)} to isolate A via intersection. Track any new rotation keys after T6."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-pinky-top", "L-ring-top", "R-ring-home", "R-index-home-in"],
  "note": "From T10: {L-pinky-top,R-middle-top,L-ring-top,R-ring-home}={A,O,W,Z}. Using T9 constraint, L-pinky-top∈{O,Z} and R-middle-top is opposite. Also L-ring-top& R-ring-home are {A,W}. Next (T11) press {L-pinky-top,L-ring-top,R-ring-home,R-index-home-in}; expect returned set={A,W, (F or N), (O or Z)} to identify L-pinky-top (O vs Z)."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-ring-top", "L-pinky-top", "R-index-home-in", "R-middle-top"],
  "locks": {
    "L-pinky-top": "Z",
    "R-index-home-in": "N",
    "R-middle-top": "O"
  },
  "note": "From T11(no rotation): L-pinky-top=Z; R-index-home-in=N; {L-ring-top,R-ring-home}={A,W}. Plan: in this press, other 3 letters are {N,O,Z}; if returned set has A => L-ring-top=A (else W). Then R-ring-home=opposite."
}

{
  "presses": [
    "L-pinky-top",
    "L-ring-top",
    "R-index-home-in",
    "L-pinky-home"
  ],
  "locks": {
    "L-ring-top": "A",
    "R-ring-home": "W"
  },
  "note": "Known after T12: L-pinky-top=Z; R-index-home-in=N; L-ring-top=A; R-middle-top=O; R-ring-home=W. Next chord presses {L-pinky-top,L-ring-top,R-index-home-in,L-pinky-home}; from returned set S, deduce L-pinky-home = the 4th symbol in S\{Z,A,N} if rotation notice shows none of those 3 known keys rotated. If any of the 3 known keys rotated, redo using rotation notice."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-pinky-top", "L-ring-top", "L-ring-home", "L-middle-home"],
  "locks": {
    "L-pinky-top": "Z",
    "L-ring-top": "A",
    "L-middle-top": "O",
    "R-index-home-in": "N",
    "R-ring-home": "W"
  },
  "note": "Known so far (no rotations in those turns): L-pinky-top=Z; L-ring-top=A; L-middle-top=O; R-index-home-in=N; R-ring-home=W. T14 press {L-pinky-top,L-ring-top,L-ring-home,L-middle-home}; if no rotation then L-ring-home & L-middle-home are the 2 remaining symbols after removing {A,Z}. If rotation hits any of these, ignore those keys’ inference."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-index-home", "L-ring-top", "L-pinky-top", "R-index-home-in"],
  "locks": {
    "L-middle-home": "J"
  },
  "note": "T16: L-middle-home=J (no rotations). Known: L-ring-home=T, L-ring-top=A, L-pinky-top=Z, R-index-home-in=N, L-middle-home=J. T17 press {L-index-home, L-ring-top, L-pinky-top, R-index-home-in}; if rotation hits any of these 4 ignore else L-index-home = output symbol not in {A,Z,N}."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-index-home", "L-ring-top", "R-index-home-in", "L-index-home-in"],
  "note": "Known (no rotations so far): L-ring-home=T, L-ring-top=A, L-pinky-top=Z, L-middle-home=J, R-index-home-in=N, L-index-home=P. T18 chord {L-index-home, L-ring-top, R-index-home-in, L-index-home-in}; output set {P,A,N,X} => L-index-home-in=X IF no rotation hits these 4. If rotation notice hits any of the 4, mark those as rotated-uncertain (don’t fix individual)."
}

{
  "presses": [
    "L-ring-top",
    "L-middle-home",
    "L-index-home-in",
    "L-middle-top"
  ],
  "note": "T18 chord {L-ring-top(A), L-middle-home(J), L-index-home-in(Y), L-middle-top(?)}. From output set remove {A,J,Y}; remaining symbol = L-middle-top if no rotations among these 4. If rotation notice includes any of these 4, mark L-middle-top-uncertain only; keep A,J,Y fixed for their keys unless rotated."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-ring-top", "L-middle-home", "L-index-home-in", "L-pinky-home"],
  "locks": {
    "L-ring-top": "A",
    "L-middle-home": "J",
    "L-index-home-in": "Y"
  },
  "note": "T18 no-rot confirmed: L-ring-top=A, L-middle-home=J, L-index-home-in=Y, L-middle-top=C. T19 press {L-ring-top,L-middle-home,L-index-home-in,L-pinky-home} (locks A,J,Y). Next turn19 output set S. If rotation notice says NONE of these 4 rotated => L-pinky-home = S minus {A,J,Y} (the remaining symbol). If any of these 4 rotated => L-pinky-home uncertain (cannot assign uniquely)."
}
